--   Source: Z. Chen, A. Gohari, A. Javanmard, H. Lin, V. Mirrokni, C. Nair, D. P. Woodruff, *A Proof of the Most Informative Boolean Function Conjecture*, arXiv:2609.24931 (2026). Lean development: https://github.com/dpwoodru/general-courtade-kumar-lean (Apache-2.0), module `CKLaneG3.S.C0.B14 (piece 1 of 4) (piece 2 of 3)` from release v1.0 (`sources_v3.tar.zst`).
